Package: njlea
Type: Package
Title: Registry of New Jersey Law Enforcement Agencies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tor", "Gunston", , "tor.gunston@protonmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A shared registry of New Jersey law enforcement agencies from
    2020, for the NJ Office of the Attorney General dataset packages. Stable
    agency identifiers, name epochs, level and function, FBI ORIs,
    municipalities served, and every source spelling of each agency.
